FORMAT: 1A

# 会话代理配置 API

会话代理配置管理 API，用于管理会话中的工具启用状态和 MCP 服务器配置。

# Group 会话代理配置

会话代理配置相关资源。

## 命令执行 [/session_agent_config/command]

执行各种会话代理配置命令的统一入口点。

### 执行命令 [POST]

执行指定的命令，发生异常时自动执行回滚操作。

使用分布式锁确保同一会话的命令不会并发执行。

+ Request (application/json)

所有命令请求的通用结构：

        {
            "command_name": "命令名称",
            "session_id": "会话ID，用于隔离不同会话的命令执行",
            "params": {
                // 命令特定参数
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + command_name (string, required) - 命令名称
    + session_id (string, required) - 会话 ID，用于隔离不同会话的命令执行
    + params (object, optional) - 命令特定参数，默认为空对象

#### get_tools_status - 获取工具状态

获取会话中指定工具或所有工具的启用和显式加载状态。

读取命令支持可选的 `branch_name` 参数，用于读取 overlay 合并后的有效配置。不提供时返回基础配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "get_tools_status",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "tool_names": ["ask_user_choice", "todo_write"],
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + tool_names (array[string], optional) - 要查询的工具名称列表，为空表示获取所有工具
    + branch_name (string, optional) - 分支名称，用于读取 overlay 合并后的有效配置。不提供时返回基础配置

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "tools_status": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true,
                        "explicit": false
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": true,
                        "explicit": false
                    }
                ]
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "get_tools_status",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### update_tools_status - 更新工具状态

更新会话中工具的启用和显式加载状态。

写入命令需要 `branch_name` 参数，修改目标分支叶子任务的 `storage_snapshot` 中的 overlay。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "update_tools_status",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "tools_status": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true,
                        "explicit": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": false
                    }
                ],
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + tools_status (array[object], required) - 要更新的工具状态列表
        + tool_name (string) - 工具名称
        + enabled (boolean) - 工具是否启用
        + explicit (boolean, optional) - 工具是否显式加载，不提供则不修改此字段
    + branch_name (string, required) - 分支名称，用于写入 overlay

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "updated_tools": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true,
                        "explicit": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": false,
                        "explicit": false
                    }
                ]
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "update_tools_status",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### get_mcp_servers_config - 获取 MCP 服务器配置

获取会话的 MCP 服务器配置。

读取命令支持可选的 `branch_name` 参数，用于读取 overlay 合并后的有效配置。不提供时返回基础配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "get_mcp_servers_config",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + branch_name (string, optional) - 分支名称，用于读取 overlay 合并后的有效配置。不提供时返回基础配置

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "enabled": true,
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "json_response": false,
                        "include_server_name_in_tool_name": true,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        },
                        "explicit": false
                    }
                ]
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "get_mcp_servers_config",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### update_mcp_servers_config - 更新 MCP 服务器配置

更新会话的 MCP 服务器配置。

写入命令需要 `branch_name` 参数，修改目标分支叶子任务的 `storage_snapshot` 中的 overlay。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "update_mcp_servers_config",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + servers (array[object], required) - MCP 服务器配置列表（每个 server 的 name 必须唯一）
        + enabled (boolean, optional) - 是否连接 MCP Server。默认: `true`
        + url (string, required) - MCP Server 的 streamable HTTP URL
        + name (string, required) - Server 名称，用于日志和错误信息
        + timeout (number, optional) - 连接和调用超时时间（秒）。默认: `30.0`
        + json_response (boolean, optional) - MCP 响应模式。`false` 使用 SSE 模式，`true` 使用 JSON 模式。默认: `false`
        + include_server_name_in_tool_name (boolean, optional) - 是否在工具名称前添加 server 前缀。默认: `true`
        + tool_filter (object, optional) - 工具过滤配置
            + allow_list (array[string], optional) - 允许的工具名称列表（白名单），为空则允许所有工具
            + deny_list (array[string], optional) - 禁止的工具名称列表（黑名单）
        + explicit (boolean, optional) - 是否显式加载工具。默认: `false`
    + branch_name (string, required) - 分支名称，用于写入 overlay

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "enabled": true,
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "json_response": false,
                        "include_server_name_in_tool_name": true,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        },
                        "explicit": false
                    }
                ]
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "update_mcp_servers_config",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### test_mcp_connection - 测试 MCP 服务器连接

测试会话配置的 MCP 服务器连接状态。

支持可选的 `branch_name` 参数，用于读取 overlay 合并后的有效配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "test_mcp_connection",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "mode": "all",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + mode (string, optional) - 测试模式: `all` 测试所有服务器, `single` 测试单个服务器。默认: `all`
    + server_name (string, optional) - 要测试的服务器名称，仅在 `mode=single` 时有效
    + branch_name (string, optional) - 分支名称，用于读取有效配置。不提供时使用基础配置

+ Response 200 (application/json) - 成功示例

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "results": [
                    {
                        "server_name": "default",
                        "server_url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "status": "success",
                        "server_info": {
                            "name": "MCP Server",
                            "protocol_version": "2024-11-05"
                        },
                        "tools": [
                            {
                                "name": "get_weather",
                                "description": "Get weather information",
                                "input_schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"city": {"type": "string"}}}
                            }
                        ],
                        "tool_count": 1,
                        "error_message": null,
                        "error_type": null,
                        "response_time_ms": 125.34,
                        "tested_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00+00:00"
                    }
                ],
                "total_servers": 1,
                "success_count": 1,
                "failed_count": 0
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "test_mcp_connection",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json) - 连接失败示例

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "results": [
                    {
                        "server_name": "default",
                        "server_url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "status": "failed",
                        "server_info": null,
                        "tools": [],
                        "tool_count": 0,
                        "error_message": "Connection refused",
                        "error_type": "ConnectionError",
                        "response_time_ms": 5.23,
                        "tested_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00+00:00"
                    }
                ],
                "total_servers": 1,
                "success_count": 0,
                "failed_count": 1
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "test_mcp_connection",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### project.create - 在会话中启用项目

将项目目录（及可选的记忆目录）添加到会话的工具可访问目录列表中。

写入命令需要 `branch_name` 参数。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "project.create",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "project_path": "my_project",
                "enable_memory": true,
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径
    + enable_memory (boolean, optional) - 是否同时启用记忆目录。默认: `true`
    + branch_name (string, required) - 分支名称，用于写入 overlay

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "success": true,
                "project_path": "my_project",
                "memory_enabled": true
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "project.create",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "success": false,
            "data": null,
            "error_message": "项目已在会话中启用: my_project",
            "command_name": "project.create",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### project.exists - 查询项目是否在会话中启用

检查项目目录是否在会话的工具可访问目录列表中。

读取命令支持可选的 `branch_name` 参数，用于读取 overlay 合并后的有效配置。不提供时返回基础配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "project.exists",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "project_path": "my_project",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径
    + branch_name (string, optional) - 分支名称，用于读取 overlay 合并后的有效配置。不提供时返回基础配置

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "exists": true,
                "project_path": "my_project"
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "project.exists",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### project.delete - 在会话中禁用项目

从会话的工具可访问目录列表中移除项目目录和记忆目录。

写入命令需要 `branch_name` 参数。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "project.delete",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "project_path": "my_project",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径
    + branch_name (string, required) - 分支名称，用于写入 overlay

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "success": true,
                "project_path": "my_project"
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "project.delete",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### project.create_memory - 在会话中启用项目记忆

为已启用的项目单独启用记忆目录。项目必须已在会话中启用。

写入命令需要 `branch_name` 参数。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "project.create_memory",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "project_path": "my_project",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径
    + branch_name (string, required) - 分支名称，用于写入 overlay

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "success": true,
                "project_path": "my_project"
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "project.create_memory",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "success": false,
            "data": null,
            "error_message": "项目未在会话中启用: my_project",
            "command_name": "project.create_memory",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### 通用错误响应

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "Command unknown_command not found"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "success": false,
            "data": null,
            "error_message": "Input validation failed: ...",
            "command_name": "command_name",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }
